<title>BELGIUM: Brussels suspends Club Med, follows Paris.</title>
<headline>Brussels suspends Club Med, follows Paris.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brussels bourse said on Friday it had suspended share trading in French leisure group Club Mediterranee pending a statement from the company later in the day, following a similar move by the Paris stock exchange.</p>
<p>Trading would resume in the stock in Brussels on Monday unless there was advice to the contrary, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
